Patch mode: comparisons use only the source lines quoted in the
patches.

═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES                                              *
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that patch. A sign-less line with one
number is an edit both patches make: a new number means both add it,
an old number means both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│oldfile.c                ┃ old new│oldfile.c
        │@@                       ┃        │@@
   1    │#include <stdio.h>       ┃   1    │#include <stdio.h>
-  2    │int main() { return 0; } ┃-  2    │int main() { return 42; }
-  3    │/* version 1 */          ┃-  3    │/* version 2 */
